00:09:33,913 --> 00:09:39,913
I Can Only Imagine is a music, drama film directed by Andrew Erwin.

3
00:14:20,869 --> 00:14:26,869
Growing up in Greenville, Texas, Bart Millard suffers physical and
emotional abuse at the hands of his father, Arthur.

4
00:19:07,826 --> 00:19:13,826
When Arthur becomes terminally ill, he finds redemption by embracing
his faith and rediscovering his love for his son.

5
00:23:54,782 --> 00:24:00,782
Years later, Bart's troubled childhood and mended relationship with his dad inspires him to
write the hit song "I Can Only Imagine" as singer of the Christian band MercyMe.

